# Demo for API

This project was generated using [Node.js Express Generator](https://expressjs.com/en/starter/generator.html).
Node.js version 18.16.0 was used for development.
server is running on port 3000.
server uses for testing purposes for ELK stack.

# Install dependencies and start the server

```bash
npm install
node server_node.js
```

# Test the API (using curl)

```bash
curl http://localhost:3000/metrics
```

provides metrics for Prometheus.

```bash
curl http://localhost:3000/products/:id
```

will return 503 error for product.

```bash
curl http://localhost:3000/products
```

will return all products but request will fail with 500 error in 50% of cases.

```bash
curl http://localhost:3000/getIncorrectProducts
```

will return products with incorrect data (missing name or price).

```bash
curl http://localhost:3000/missing-data
```

will return not found error for missing data endpoint.
